Error [E0120]: `text` was not moved here, so it cannot be taken with the move marker `^`
  --> borrowed_parameter_binding_never_inserts_hidden_copy.jet:3:14
    |
  3 |     alias :: text
    |              ^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Copy it instead: `alias :: text.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120
